Scope

This license covers the port's own source: the Z80 code under src/ (except
src/res/), the Python and C tools under tools/, the build files and the
documentation.

It does not cover, and grants no rights to:

- Dune II - The Battle for Arrakis itself, or anything taken out of it - the
  data, pictures, text, music and effects under src/res/, and whatever the
  build produces from them.  Those belong to their rights holders (Westwood
  Studios, Virgin Interactive and their successors).
- src/res/external.mod, a module supplied by its own author.
- Third-party software the toolchain fetches or builds (libxpeccy,
  sjasmplus, FCEUmm, Genesis Plus GX, the BaseConf firmware, the General
  Sound ROM), each of which stays under its own license.
